      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, me too. Sometimes it is right after the new welcome screen, some times after an hour, sometimes when I try to go to a different world, my display will go black and then I hear the pc rebooting. My specs are similar and have never had this problem with any game before. It has happened, no bs, at least 100 times since the update.",
