  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T23:18:00.199Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After the security update, my computer will not continue to play vrchat and will suddenly reboot during vr.\nI get this problem all times after the update. I have never seen this before update.\nThe pc quits abnormally after an hour or as early as 20 minutes.\nI thought it was a hardware problem, but I have no problems with other games, VR titles or hardware benchmarks.\nI bought this pc a month ago.\nI gathered information and found that players using the same CPU and M/B are having similar problems.\nIt seems to be related to EAC.\nAs a premise, I am not using any mods or modding client.\nForgive me that I am using a translation and may be using incorrect English.\nI sincerely hope that a solution will be presented.\nMy PC\nCPU: Ryzen7 5800X\nM/B: AsRock B550 STEEL LEGEND\nGPU:RTX3060 12GB\nRAM:DDR4 32GB\nOS: Windows10 21H2\nHMD:Meta Quest2",
